  "description": "Single storey, wrap-around, rear extension",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-859e075d-7fff-bcb2-5e89-a96b7a65197a&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposal due to its height, and its relationship to the existing dwelling and neighbouring dwelling No.23 is deemed to result in an unsympathetic dominant addition to the rear elevation of the dwelling which would be uneighbourly and is not considered to be of high quality design. The proposal would therefore fail to comply with Policy LP1 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 Strategic Planning (2020), Policies D4 of the London Plan 2021, Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (2025) and the NPPF.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-e75a0848-7fff-5b11-a97b-9e066ff29446&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposal due to its height and proximity to neighbouring property No.23’s rear and side ground floor elevation windows would result in the perception of enclosure and an overbearing impact. The proposed development would have an unacceptable impact on the residential amenity of neighbouring occupiers and would fail to comply with LP33 policy LP2 and the REA SPD (2025).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
